DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: MITSUBISHI HC FINANCE AMERICA LLC\nRoadshow: www.netroadshow.com |
  Entry Code: MHC2026 (not case sensitive)\n\nDeal context:\nMitsubishi HC 
 Finance America LLC\, a subsidiary of Mitsubishi HC Capital Inc. (rated A3
 /A-/A- stable by Moody's/S&P/Fitch)\, has mandated five joint bookrunners 
 for a $500 million (with no-grow) 5-year 144A/Reg S senior unsecured note 
 offering\, fully and unconditionally guaranteed by the parent on a senior 
 unsecured basis. The deal is at the mandate stage\, subject to market cond
 itions\, with expected ratings of A3/A- from Moody's and S&P. This is a Ya
 nkee bond offering from a Japanese financial services parent with FCA/ICMA
  stabilization applying.
